        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity mix
Electricity domestic net production and import shares are based on IEA statistics 2008.;
UUID: 8ea287b6-2778-3caa-b640-0375c91067ea
It includes the shares of domestic electricity production by technology and imports from neighbouring countries (production mixes) at the busbar. It does not include transformation, transport nor distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers in Serbia.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current (2004) average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used (2008).
Production volume: 43 TWh
Sampling: Statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8ea287b6-2778-3caa-b640-0375c91067ea.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
